 *
 * Class hierarchy:
 *   ReadOnlyPropertyList  (read-only, both modes)
 *     └── PropertyList    (sync mutations in static mode; throws in dynamic mode)
 *          └── CookieList (overrides add/upsert/remove/clear/delete with async jar ops)
